@port = 5121
@host = http://localhost:{{port}}

### Register Multi-Role User
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gordon.everywhere@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Gordon Ramsay",
  "roles": ["Vendor", "Customer"]
}

### Login as gordon
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gordon.everywhere@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login as varsha
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}


### Create a Restaurant (Requires Vendor JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..EVkwG7LxuHDUSBRalV_i6WKq7P2ts3WmtstNgy91-Lw

{
  "name": "The Royal Gordon Ramsay Hotel",
  "address": "Las Vegas Blvd"
}

### Add a Menu Item (Requires Gordon's JWT)
POST {{host}}/api/menuitem
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..EVkwG7LxuHDUSBRalV_i6WKq7P2ts3WmtstNgy91-Lw

{
  "name": "Beef Wellington",
  "description": "A prime fillet of beef wrapped in puff pastry.",
  "price": 45.99,
  "restaurantId": "01a0914f-6cc7-79e8-b217-dcb310df786b"
}


### Get all restaurants and their menus (Public)
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant


